  "question": {
    "text": "A particle acted on by constant forces $4 \\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k}$ and $3 \\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-\\hat{k}$ to the point $5 \\hat{i}+4 \\hat{j}-\\hat{k}$. The total work done by the forces is"
